  "instructions": [
    "Heat ghee in a large pan over medium heat.",
    "Add cumin seeds and let them sizzle for a few seconds.",
    "Add onion, garlic, and ginger, and cook until the onion is translucent.",
    "Add coriander powder, turmeric powder, salt, and black pepper, and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add red lentils, Chinese sesame sauce, and 2 cups of water, and bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low, cover the pan, and simmer for 20 minutes or until the lentils are tender.",
    "Mash some of the lentils to create a thick and creamy texture.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with chopped fresh cilantro or scallions."
